    "sections": {
        "description": "Beauty Cosmetics Lite Theme is a clean and responsive website design focused on presenting beauty-related content, products, services, and visual media in an organized layout. Its structured homepage can display featured content, promotional sections, service information, and selected products without requiring complex page arrangements. The responsive layout adapts content to different screen sizes, supporting browsing on desktops, tablets, and mobile devices. The Beauty Cosmetics Lite theme includes customizable sections that can be adjusted to match the structure and content of a website. Navigation menus help organize pages and categories, while social media integration can connect visitors with external profiles. Image-focused sections provide space for product photography, service presentations, blog posts, and other visual content. Beauty Cosmetics Lite Theme can also support eCommerce-oriented layouts for displaying product categories, product details, and shopping-related content. Blog sections allow articles, beauty tips, tutorials, and updates to be presented in a readable format. Its simple structure provides a practical foundation for creating a beauty-focused website with consistent navigation, content sections, images, and product information."
    },
